---
import AppLayout from "../../layouts/AppLayout.astro";
import PipelineNav from "../../components/PipelineNav.astro";
---
<AppLayout title="Publish Creative OS" section="publish">
  <PipelineNav active="publish" />
  <header class="page-head"><div class="head-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Operations / publication boundaries</p><h1>Publish deliberately.</h1><p class="lede">Publishing the Creative OS means choosing a purpose-built surface—not dumping the internal archive onto the web.</p></div></header>
  <div class="grid grid-3">
    <section class="card pipeline-card acid"><div class="card-kicker">Private / internal OS</div><h3>The complete operating system</h3><p>Archive concepts, remediation, decisions, private notes, all provenance states, risky material, and retired history. This is the fullest bundle and should remain controlled.</p></section>
    <section class="card pipeline-card"><div class="card-kicker">Public archive</div><h3>The reviewed creative library</h3><p>Approved or intentionally shared concepts with internal workflow detail removed. Public does not mean canon; status remains visible.</p></section>
    <section class="card pipeline-card violet"><div class="card-kicker">Para-specific export</div><h3>A product-scoped pack</h3><p>Only concepts, mechanics, identity patterns, and cautions relevant to Para. Exclude obsolete paid-legitimacy proposals.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><div class="card-kicker">Faction packet</div><h3>A focused symbolic system</h3><p>Principles, convergences, Morphlings, Vanguards, mortal expressions, and their player-facing translations.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><div class="card-kicker">Project starter packet</div><h3>A reusable design seed</h3><p>A compact selection of concepts, reuse rules, and guardrails for a new EGGS game.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><div class="card-kicker">Remediation-only report</div><h3>A governance handoff</h3><p>Tasks, decisions, risks, affected sources, and expected outputs without creative-library presentation.</p></section>
  </div>
  <section class="warning-panel" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="card-kicker">Exclude from public publishing</div><h2>Not everything portable is publishable.</h2><ul class="mini-list"><li>Unresolved legal or monetization risks</li><li>Unreviewed AI assets and incomplete generation provenance</li><li>Unlicensed or unknown-rights art</li><li>Private notes, personal data, or contributor details without consent</li><li>Retired ideas not intentionally presented as development history</li><li>Cashout, wagering, paid-legitimacy, or gambling-framed Para material</li></ul></section>
  <div class="cta-row"><a class="button acid" href="/pipeline/exports">Review export bundles</a><a class="button secondary" href="/pipeline/rights">Open rights review</a></div>
</AppLayout>
